{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00811","headline":"郊庙歌辞 後唐宗庙乐舞辞 武成舞 · 崔居俭、卢文纪","name":"郊庙歌辞 後唐宗庙乐舞辞 武成舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"艰难王业，返正皇唐。\n先天再造，却日重光。\n汉绍世祖，夏资少康。\n功成德茂，率祀无疆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔居俭、卢文纪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00811.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00811","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}